# The #5236 defect: a contribution rejected for a reserved group key leaves the
# key's prior membership in place, so the view is no longer a function of the
# source.
MODULE: QuiescentExactRejectKeepsPrior
TARGET: QuiescentExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a reserved group key keeps the source key's prior contribution instead of retracting it
PERTURBS: Flip

--- FIND
           new == Extract(e, viewDefn)
           old == mem[k]
--- REPLACE
           new == IF Grp(e) = "R" THEN mem[k] ELSE Extract(e, viewDefn)
           old == mem[k]
--- END
